836 0 obj
  << /ActualText (How the section reads\054 so you can walk your team through it\072 Lexli AI at the top is the only brand\054 with a single arrow down \024 \042one brand\054 one product\042 \024 into the Lexli Platform hub\056 The left column \050blue\054 dashed\054 matching your board\047s convention\051 is the platform core\072 accounts and profiles\054 AI Assistant\054 Advanced Search\054 Legal Research\054 and Case Management as the data spine\056 The right column \050yellow\051 is the six tools \024 and this is the key structural change from your diagram 2\072 they hang off the Platform itself\054 not off a sibling \042Products\042 node\056 Four of them \050Daily Board\054 Legal Translator\054 Document Scanner\054 Case Finder\051 get an orange dashed \042Public Front Door\042 badge \024 free standalone entry with its own landing page and search intent \024 with the dashed arrow pointing into the tool\054 showing doors funnel inward\056 At the bottom\054 the three green website doorways from Ayush\047s homepage ideation\072 Advocates and Law Firms \046 Businesses route to the platform story\054 Citizens route \042free tools first\042 into the front doors\056 The white note captures the whole thesis in three lines\056\n\nYou also have the same diagram as a persisted artifact in your Cowork sidebar \050from earlier\051\054 which is handy for sharing outside Figma\056 Everything in the FigJam section is normal shapes and connectors\054 so feel free to drag things around \024 nothing is grouped weirdly\056\n\nTwo things worth deciding next\072 which tools actually get front doors \050I picked the four with obvious citizen\055grade or high\055search\055intent use \024 Drafting and eFilling feel advocate\055only\054 so they stay inside\051\054 and whether the free tier of each door is truly free or a teaser with limits\056 Happy to pressure\055test either\054 or turn this IA into a concrete website sitemap with page\055by\055page content next\056)
     /K [ 159 ]
     /P 837 0 R
     /Pg 518 0 R
     /S /Span
