1420 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Security\072\nWe leverage world\055class infrastructure providers to make sure your data stays encrypted\054 protected\054 and always available\056 Lexli runs on Azure\031s audited data centers\054 Cloud\055flare shields every edge\054 and encryption plus least\055privilege access guard every action end to end\056\015\n\015\nSOC 2 Type II\015\055 Aligned\015\nISO 27001\015\055 Aligned\nGDPR\015\055 Ready\015\nBuilt on audited\054 industry\055leading infrastructure\015\n\015\nAzure\015\nAWS S3\015\nGCP\015\nCloudflare\015\nVercel\015\n\nHosted on Azure\015\055 We inherit Azure\031s physical security\054 environmental controls\054 redundant power\054 and compliance baseline\056\015\nData Encryption\015\055 Every payload is encrypted at rest with AES\055256 and in transit via TLS 1\0563 across public networks\056\015\nNetwork Protection \055 Cloudflare provides WAF coverage\054 DDoS mitigation\054 and global CDN acceleration before traffic reaches us\056\015\nStrict Access Control \055 Production access is least\055privilege\054 short\055lived\054 fully logged\054 and reviewed to keep actions traceable\056)
     /K [ 451 ]
     /P 1421 0 R
     /Pg 518 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
