1422 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Integrations\072\nLexli connects with the systems Indian legal practice actually runs on\054 so existing processes do not need to be rebuilt\056\nCase status\054 orders\054 hearing history and party details come from official live court records by CNR\054 case number\054 party or advocate name \055 across the Supreme Court\054 High Courts\054 District Courts and Tribunals\056 Cause lists are pulled and reconciled as courts publish them\054 so tomorrow\047s board reflects the real list\054 not yesterday\047s copy of it\056\n e\055Filing packets are prepared to the format each portal expects and submitted through your own credentials\054 with the eDraft reviewed and approved by you before anything leaves the platform\056\nLexli works alongside how a practice already runs\054 rather than asking a team to move everything first\056 Existing files\054 diaries\054 templates and habits stay as they are\054 and the tools sit on top of what already works well\056)
     /K [ 452 ]
     /P 1423 0 R
     /Pg 518 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
